    "body": "Ready for review.\n\nBranch is now up to date with `main` (d47a306b merged in), and GitHub reports the PR as **mergeable / CLEAN** — the `conflicts` label is stale and can be dropped.\n\nGate status on the branch head (`90a471fb`):\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` — 442 passed, 0 failed\n- `cargo clippy -D warnings` — clean\n- release build opens; ribbon and viewport verified at 2560x1540\n\nNote: repo CI is `workflow_dispatch` only, so no checks are expected to appear here; the local gate above is the evidence.\n\nScope unchanged: 8 files, +203/-58, all under `crates/ui` (ribbon cells + labels, tab titles, font tokens, empty-viewport hint, Z=0 ground grid, plus the `structural.rs` / `law_tests.rs` pins).\n",
